  "title": "ESLint fails on an import the PR left behind in CartSummary",
  "description": "PR #962 adds a 'You save' row to the cart summary and moves amount rendering into a new <Money> component. CartSummary.tsx no longer calls formatCurrency but still imports it, so `eslint .` reports `4:10 error 'formatCurrency' is defined but never used` (@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars) and exits 1. The same output also contains a react-hooks/exhaustive-deps warning in src/hooks/useShippingQuote.ts, a file the PR did not touch; it is only a warning (no --max-warnings) and was already present on main, so it is not the cause. test and build pass (tsconfig has no noUnusedLocals, so tsc -b does not catch it) and deploy-preview is skipped. Correct answer: code (lint) failure; remove the unused formatCurrency import from src/components/CartSummary.tsx.",
